    <bpmn:process id="W_W1402" name="W1402. DC Seasonal Merchandise Pre-Staging, Forward-Pick Slot Reallocation &amp; Promotional Lane Setup" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Upcoming seasonal event or major promotional catalog launch (from S&amp;OP calendar W13); typically 3–4 weeks before promotional go-live date
Frequency: 6 major catalog-based promotions per year + 4 seasonal transitions (summer, rainy season, ber-months, post-holiday) = ~10 pre-staging events/year per DC
Volume: ~500–800 promotional SKUs per major catalog event; ~200–300 seasonal transition SKUs; across 4 DCs and ~10 events/year = ~15,000–24,000 SKU-location pre-staging set-ups/year
Owner: DC Operations Manager
Participants: DC Operations Manager, Warehouse Supervisor, Inventory Planner, Merchandising Coordinator, Receiving Lead
Source: workflow W1402 — DC Seasonal Merchandise Pre-Staging, Forward-Pick Slot Reallocation &amp; Promotional Lane Setup</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1402_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1402_Lane1" name="Merchandising Coordinator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1402_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1402_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1402_Lane2" name="DC Operations Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1402_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1402_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1402_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1402_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1402_Task14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1402_Task16</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1402_Lane3" name="Warehouse Supervisor">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1402_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1402_Task15</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1402_Lane4" name="Receiving Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1402_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1402_End17</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1402_Start6" name="Upcoming seasonal event or major promotional catalog launch (from S&amp;OP calendar W13)…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1402_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1402_Task7" name="Merchandising Coordinator distributes promotional/seasonal SKU list to DC…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Merchandising Coordinator distributes promotional/seasonal SKU list to DC Operations Manager: item numbers, expected velocity (A/B/C classification for the promotion), planned quantity per DC, and go-live date; list arrives 3–4 weeks before go-live per S&amp;OP calendar (W13)
Responsible (R): Merchandising Coordinator
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: 1 day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1402_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1402_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1402_Task8" name="DC Operations Manager reviews current forward-pick slot utilization: identifies…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: DC Operations Manager reviews current forward-pick slot utilization: identifies which current forward-pick SKUs are end-of-season or low-velocity candidates for relocation to reserve storage
Responsible (R): DC Operations Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1402_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1402_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1402_Task9" name="DC Operations Manager creates slot reallocation plan: (a) remove end-of-season…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: DC Operations Manager creates slot reallocation plan: (a) remove end-of-season SKUs from forward-pick to reserve storage, (b) assign incoming promotional/seasonal SKUs to vacated forward-pick slots by velocity (A-items nearest to dispatch bay), (c) update bin/location master in WMS for each moved SKU
Responsible (R): DC Operations Manager / Warehouse Supervisor
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 3 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1402_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1402_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1402_Task10" name="Warehouse team executes slot reallocation: physically move end-of-season…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Warehouse team executes slot reallocation: physically move end-of-season inventory from forward-pick to reserve locations; update WMS bin confirmation per move; sweep and clean forward-pick locations for incoming promotional SKUs
Responsible (R): Warehouse Supervisor / DC Staff
Accountable (A): DC Operations Manager
Duration: 1–2 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1402_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1402_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1402_Task11" name="As promotional/seasonal merchandise arrives through standard receiving (W3)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: As promotional/seasonal merchandise arrives through standard receiving (W3), receiving team prioritizes putaway to the pre-assigned forward-pick locations rather than default reserve storage; WMS directs putaway to the designated promotional forward-pick slots
Responsible (R): Receiving Lead / System
Accountable (A): DC Operations Manager
Duration: Ongoing during receiving</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1402_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1402_Flow25</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1402_Task12" name="DC Operations Manager monitors forward-pick slot fill rate daily: system shows…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: DC Operations Manager monitors forward-pick slot fill rate daily: system shows % of promotional SKUs that have reached forward-pick locations vs. total planned; target: 100% fill by T-3 days before go-live
Responsible (R): DC Operations Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 15 min/day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1402_Flow25</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1402_Flow26</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1402_Task13" name="If fill rate is below target at T-7 days: DC Operations Manager escalates to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: If fill rate is below target at T-7 days: DC Operations Manager escalates to Inventory Planner and Buyer for expedited PO fulfillment or inter-DC transfer (W22) to fill gaps
Responsible (R): DC Operations Manager
Accountable (A): Supply Planning Manager
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1402_Flow26</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1402_Flow27</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1402_Task14" name="At go-live (T-0): DC Operations Manager confirms all promotional forward-pick…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: At go-live (T-0): DC Operations Manager confirms all promotional forward-pick slots are stocked; sends &quot;Promo Ready&quot; confirmation to Merchandising Coordinator and Store Operations; first wave of store replenishment orders (W4) for promotional SKUs is released
Responsible (R): DC Operations Manager
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1402_Flow27</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1402_Flow28</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1402_Task15" name="During promotion: DC monitors forward-pick depletion rates daily; triggers…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 9: During promotion: DC monitors forward-pick depletion rates daily; triggers emergency replenishment from reserve storage to forward-pick when slot quantity drops below 2-day supply; adjusts reserve-to-forward replenishment triggers in WMS for high-velocity promotional SKUs
Responsible (R): Warehouse Supervisor / System
Accountable (A): DC Operations Manager
Duration: 15 min/day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1402_Flow28</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1402_Flow29</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1402_Task16" name="Post-promotion: DC Operations Manager reviews residual promotional inventory in…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 10: Post-promotion: DC Operations Manager reviews residual promotional inventory in forward-pick; coordinates with Merchandising for clearance markdown (W532) or return-to-vendor (W88); remaining stock relocated back to reserve storage or dispositioned per W220 (SLOB)
Responsible (R): DC Operations Manager / Warehouse Supervisor
Accountable (A): Merchandising Coordinator
Duration: 1 day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1402_Flow29</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1402_Flow30</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1402_End17" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1402_Flow30</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1402_Annotation18">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-252 (ensure controlled execution — DC Operations Management (PA-04.3).) | - operational: DC Operations Manager review and approval gate
Owner: DC Operations Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1402_Assoc19" sourceRef="W1402_Annotation18" targetRef="W1402_Start6" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1402_Flow20" sourceRef="W1402_Start6" targetRef="W1402_Task7" />
